SUMMARY:LuxDeluxe
LOCATION:Iron Horse\, 18 Center St\, Northampton\, MA 01060
DESCRIPTION:with Ciarra Fragale\nThe first thing you’ll notice about LuxD
 exlue is the singer\, Ned King. He might be high-kicking\, rolling on the 
 floor\, or squeezed up alongside drummer Jake Edwards with his own set of 
 sticks in hand. Bassist Jacob Rosazza and rhythm guitarist Jake Manzi lean
  into their mics as Ned does\, and 3-part Eagles-esque harmonies roll out.
  Then the energy shifts to stage left\, where lead guitarist Caleb Rosazza
  has started soloing\, and you know you’re in for a good night.\nhttps:/
 /theparlorroom.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket/#/events/a0SV500000CdqCjMAJ\
 nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
